Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] test page-only intake retention protection

Exercise public Journal transitions that acknowledge an occurrence independently of its pending page, then age out its completed run. Cover delivered-page cleanup and eventual cleanup after pending-page acknowledgement without production changes.

Proof: scratch HOME/HERMES_HOME scripts/run_tests.sh retention + nightly pin: 26 passed. Exact pending-page predicate mutant fails test_retention_page_only_protection[False] with [] != [1]; restored production passes. scripts/check: 20 checks, ok.
---
 tests/ci/test_flaky_intake_retention.py | 46 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 46 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tests/ci/test_flaky_intake_retention.py b/tests/ci/test_flaky_intake_retention.py
